From: Ben Williams <213356824+q8itz@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 16:52:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/9] codegen: support secondary executable modules

Discovery, function graph and project recompiler changes needed to
recompile a second title executable (Yeti_Final_Xenon.exe) alongside
default.xex.
